      "statement": "Brijio is reactive and privacy-first: the browser extension connects only after explicit user action, every browser read or action is initiated by an explicit MCP request, and the project will not add continuous streaming, cookie export, session cloning, credential extraction, MFA interception, or background surveillance.",
